---
import Info from '../components/Info.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mainImage from '../images/beryl rome pride.png';
import therianGreen from '../images/therian_green.webp';
import fisher from '../images/fisher.gif';
import bunnyTherian from '../images/bunny_therian.webp';
import animalClover from '../images/animal_clover.webp';
---
<Info title="Beryl's Therianthropy">
    <Fragment slot="image">
        <Image class="main" src={mainImage} alt="Beryl the Bunny wearing a kiwi shirt and a Trans Pride flower crown, on a Nonhuman Unity flag" style="height:auto;width:300px"/>
        <div class="credit">Therian Pride art by <a class="external" href="https://rometwin.com/about">RomeTwin</a></div>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="blinkies">
        <Image class="blinky" src={therianGreen} alt="Therian"/>
        <Image class="blinky" src={fisher} alt="I'm a Fisher"/>
        <Image class="blinky" src={bunnyTherian} alt="this user is a bunny"/>
        <Image class="blinky" src={animalClover} alt="I'm an animal"/>
    </Fragment>
    <p>
        I am a <strong>THERIAN</strong>, or in other words, on a fundamental level I view myself as a <strong>NON-HUMAN</strong> animal. Specifically, I am a <a class="external" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fisher_(animal)"><strong>FISHER</strong></a> and also an <a class="external" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_rabbit"><strong>AMERICAN BLUE RABBIT</strong></a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        Much of how I view and interact with the world is through this lens. I wish deeply for <strong>FUR</strong> and <strong>CLAWS</strong> and <strong>WHISKERS</strong> and a <strong>SNOUT</strong>. To run up a <strong>TREE</strong> and look around, or to nap with another rabbit in a <strong>SUNBEAM</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
        This intersects with my <a href="/plurality/"><strong>PLURALITY</strong></a> with both <strong>RUG</strong> and <strong>FLAX</strong> being both of my <strong>THERIOTYPES</strong>, while <strong>THE THIRD THING</strong> is only fisher.
    </p>
</Info>